{"id": "DfCskbTRXYD", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why did Hanuman ji BITE Maa Sita's pearls? 🤍 The answer is the most beautiful thing you'll hear today.\n\nAfter Shri Ram was crowned, Maa Sita took off her pearl necklace and looked at the vanaras, then at Ram, again and again. Ram said: \"Give it to the one who pleases you most.\" She gave it to Hanuman, and he shone \"like a mountain with a white cloud.\" (Valmiki Ramayana, Yuddha Kanda)\n\nThen comes the legend every dadi knows 🧡 Hanuman broke the string and bit the pearls, one by one, looking for Ram inside each. When a courtier mocked him (\"Is Ram inside YOU, then?\"), he opened his heart, and there they were: Ram and Sita. That's why Hanuman ji is shown with Ram and Sita in his heart.\n\n📚 Stories like this, for little ones: Rishi Katha Books 1–3, the set of 3 for ₹500. Order at rishikatha.com (link in bio).\n\n💛 Save this to tell your kids tonight, and share it with someone who loves Hanuman ji.\n💬 Who lives in YOUR heart? Comment their name!\n\n#hanuman #hanumanji #jaishriram #jaihanuman #siyaram #ramayan #ramayana #hanumanchalisa #bajrangbali #sitaram #hindumythology #kidsstories #indianmythology #rishikatha #sanatandharma", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793199451, "like_count": 16450, "comment_count": 122, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2186202968671160a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 50.024, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPxfKp2Cf2UawX87J68Gs97PkXcE5vTFAFDGuBCfnLie-mn3Vm1e7m_R1OsS2RBTDl__sxf1hjDlAd7bVShpru8uKggi66rlh0H8RY.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqUGtqJXX6agNA9BTUH8DIWIcDDeS1cLzSl-Pp3LqaERyFUj-lgqGJFMy8t_4Yq6QBKhunttAEA29HuriAi1g2n&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=-5QoFYPPCTAQ7kNvwH4cGF_&%3D%3